linhas.en:
#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.
You've accumulated a lot of fatigue;
any more will be dangerous!

Even by using all my #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF,
all I was able to do was "talk" to him;
he doesn't treat humans as human;
he's the arrogant king.

Her grace captivates all who see her;
so ephemeral that gentlemen must endow her;
her smile a sun shining all over 3,000 worlds.
